   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Tesla is building a <a href=\"https://openstax.org/r/teslagigafactory\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">10 million square-foot “Gigafactory”</a> in Nevada. While Tesla didn’t rely on systems selling in building the manufacturing facility, the company did contract with many suppliers, such as <a href=\"https://openstax.org/r/projecttesla\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Anning-Johnson</a>, to provide vital elements such as decking. For Tesla, this was a new task situation. List the various phases Tesla went through to arrive at the construction and operation of this lithium-ion battery Gigafactory.",
